            </div>
        </div>

        <br /><br />

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-7 about-txt">
                <h4 style="letter-spacing:5px;">
                    About
                    <br />
                    eSport (BEGTC)
                </h4>

                <p style="font-size:16px;">
                    Esport is form of sport which involves video games as means of competition.
                    <br />
                    This form of sport is take’s the form of controlled, organized video game championships specifically concerning professional individual / team players.
                    <br />
                    Motorsport Games, part of the Motorsport Network, is dedicated to virtual racing. Our mission is to combine video game with Esports to deliver exciting, innovative experiences people will race online at home, watch and engage with.
                    <br />
                </p>

            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <img class="rounded" src="~/Content/images/IMG_2018.jpg" style="width:80%;" />
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12 about-txt">
                <h4 style="letter-spacing:5px;">
                    CHAMPIONSHIP
                    <br />
                    DETAILS
                </h4>

                <p style="font-size:16px;">
                    Online Racing in Gran Turismo Sport Game.
                    <br />
                    Racers will take place between persons of the same region only. (no online playing between different regions)
                    <br />
                    The game (Garn Turismo Sport) does not hold a utility in system which can administer a championship. This will be managed externally (e.g. Signup, Incidents, protests, points, calendar etc.)
                    <br />
                    The First Bahraini Championship will consist of 5 Rounds in 5 different randomly selected international FIA circuits
                    <br />
                    The 5 rounds will be hosted over a period of 5 weeks with 1 round per weekend.
                    <br />
                    A Maximum of 15 Maximum Competitors / Drivers will be allowed to participate. (limited participants due to game limitation)
                    <br />
                    Per Championship entry qualifying will be conducted over a period of 1 day.
                    <br />
                    A total of 15 drivers will be selected based on their fastest lap time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12 about-txt">
                <h4 style="letter-spacing:5px;">
                    BAHRAIN ESPORT
                    <br />
                    NATIONAL RACE
                </h4>

                <p style="font-size:16px;">
                    The idea is to host an online championship, where racers or pro gamers who are interested in motorsport can race online and enjoy racing experience during the current global situation.
                    <br />
                    Digital motorsport is a good opportunity to keep the motorsport community in Bahrain active, entertained and united, while waiting for the world to recover and promoting stay at home.

                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

